{"author":{"id":"89da5fec8eff6d69dbcdd68f81be7e9163b16f34b17e978ecf3554487379f453"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773943335,"nonce":"gqhnkwwqkbVPS1XJkoN9aD5OkPE=","title":"P5: Hydration DAG-awareness — pass leaf param for path resolution","message":"Make the history-first hydration in TerminalPane DAG-aware by passing a leaf parameter.\n\nParent: 86b63bc\nDepends on: 40f0298 (P2 — leaf param on getConversation API)\n\n## Changes\n- ui/src/api.ts: getConversation() gains optional leaf?: string parameter, appended as ?leaf=\u003cuuid\u003e query param\n- ui/src/components/console/TerminalPane.tsx: in the hydration effect, when the Console session has resume_at_message set, pass it as the leaf parameter when fetching conversation history\n- This ensures the hydration loads the correct DAG path (the one being resumed), not the default latest-leaf path\n\n## No changes needed to:\n- conversationBlocksToStreamEvents — still receives flat list\n- computeLiveTail — still counts assistant turns\n- flushPendingSSE — content-based dedup unchanged\n- StreamRenderer — receives flat StreamEvent[]\n\n## ConsoleSession type\n- The frontend ConsoleSession type (ui/src/state.ts) needs resume_at_message?: string field\n- The state reducer for console:session:updated must propagate this field","files":null}]}